{"id":"word:hebrew:H3411","type":"word","title":"יְרֵכָה","subtitle":"H3411 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, the flank ; but used only figuratively, the rear or recess","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יְרֵכָה (H3411) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 30 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יְרֵכָה (yᵉrêkâh) means properly, the flank ; but used only figuratively, the rear or recess First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 6 16."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יְרֵכָה","transliteration":"yᵉrêkâh","pronunciation":"yer-ay-kaw'","strong":"H3411","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3411","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["יַרְכְּתֵ֣י","מִ/יַּרְכְּתֵי","בְּ/יַרְכְּתֵ֥י","וּֽ/לְ/יַרְכְּתֵ֥י","בַּ/יַּרְכָתָֽיִם"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfdc",14],["HNcfdc",7],["HRd/Ncfda",5],["HC/R/Ncfdc",2],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",1],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, the flank ; but used only figuratively, the rear or recess","usage":"border, coast, part, quarter, side.","full":"H3411. yerekah [ יַרְכָה , or יְרֵכָה Ol § 167. g ] flank, side , dual extreme parts, recesses ; — suffix יַרְכָֿתוֺ Gen 49:13 ; dual יַרְכָתַיִם Exod 26:27 ; 36:32 + Ezek 46:19 Qr (Kt ירכתם ); יַרְכָתָ֑יִם Exod 26:23 ; 36:28 ; construct יַרְכְּתֵי Judg 19:1 20 t. + 1Kin 6:16 Qr (Kt ירכותי ); — 1 side , i.e. further side of Zebulun, poetic for more distant border of his territory Gen 49:13 . 2 elsewhere always dual the two things , i.e. figurative angle, recess, extreme parts: as recesses of Mt. Ephraim Judg 19:1 , 18 ; of Lebanon 2Kin 19:23 = Isa 37:24 ; of recesses or innermost part of a cave 1Sam 24:4 ; a house Amos 6:10 ; Psa 128:3 ; the pit ( בּוֺר ) Isa 14:15 (|| שְׁאוֺל ), Ezek 32:23 ; a ship Jonah 1:5 ; צָפוֺן יַרְכְּתֵי remote parts of the north Isa 14:13 ; Ezek 38:6 , 15 ; 39:2 ; Psa 48:3 (but here Lag proposes ׳יר רצון ); אָ֑רֶץ יַרְכְּתֵי remote parts of earth Jer 6:22 ; 25:32 ; 31:8 ; 50:41 ; of a long building, extreme or hinder part , so of tabernacle Exod 26:22-23 , 27 ; 36:27-28 , 32 (all P); of temple 1Kin 6:16 ; of Ezekiel's temple Ezek 46:19 .","rootNote":"feminine of 3409 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 6 16","keyReferences":["1Kgs 6 16","1Kgs 6 16","1Sam 24 4","2Kgs 19 23","Amos 6 10","Exod 26 22","Exod 26 23","Exod 26 27"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":30,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 6 16","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מ/ירכותי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfdc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 16","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/יַּרְכְּתֵ֤י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfdc"},{"reference":"1Sam 24 4","book":"1Sam","chapter":24,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/יַרְכְּתֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfdc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 19 23","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יַרְכְּתֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc"},{"reference":"Amos 6 10","book":"Amos","chapter":6,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/יַרְכְּתֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfdc"},{"reference":"Exod 26 22","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּֽ/לְ/יַרְכְּתֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfdc"},{"reference":"Exod 26 23","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/יַּרְכָתָֽיִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfda"},{"reference":"Exod 26 27","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/יַּרְכָתַ֖יִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfda"},{"reference":"Exod 36 27","book":"Exod","chapter":36,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּֽ/לְ/יַרְכְּתֵ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfdc"},{"reference":"Exod 36 28","book":"Exod","chapter":36,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"